msgid "Triton-Ascend `do_bench_npu` 指导文档"
msgstr "Triton-Ascend `do_bench_npu` Guide"

msgid "文档定位"
msgstr "Document Overview"

msgid "本指南面向已经掌握如何编写 Triton 算子，并已了解社区 `triton.testing.do_bench` 基本概念的用户。主要介绍在昇腾 NPU 上进行性能基准测试的推荐用法："
msgstr "This guide is for users who already know how to write Triton operators and understand the basic concepts of the community `triton.testing.do_bench`. It primarily covers the recommended usage for performance benchmarking on Ascend NPUs:"

msgid "Triton-Ascend 上 `do_bench_npu` 的推荐用法；"
msgstr "Recommended usage of `do_bench_npu` on Triton-Ascend;"

msgid "在 Ascend 后端中“纯 Device 侧执行时间”的含义；"
msgstr "The meaning of \"pure Device-side execution time\" in the Ascend backend;"

msgid "何时使用默认的 `mspti` 路径，以及何时需要回退到 `torch_npu.profiler` 路径。"
msgstr "When to use the default `mspti` path and when to fall back to the `torch_npu.profiler` path."

msgid "快速上手"
msgstr "Quick Start"

msgid "在 Triton-Ascend 中，当您需要构建算子性能基线或测量 kernel 的纯硬件执行时间时，推荐导入并使用 `do_bench_npu`："
msgstr "In Triton-Ascend, when you need to build an operator performance baseline or measure the pure hardware execution time of a kernel, we recommend importing and using `do_bench_npu`:"

msgid "import torch\\n"
msgstr "import torch"

msgid "这表示："
msgstr "This means:"

msgid "`fn` 的语义与社区 `do_bench` 相同，代表要进行基准测试的可调用函数；"
msgstr "The semantics of `fn` are the same as those of the community `do_bench`, and it represents the callable function to be benchmarked;"

msgid "`do_bench_npu` 在 Triton-Ascend 上的意思是“让 NPU 性能分析工具捕获纯 Device 侧 kernel 执行时间”，从而有效消除 Host 侧开销对测量的影响。"
msgstr "In Triton-Ascend, `do_bench_npu` means \"enabling the NPU profiling tool to capture pure Device-side kernel execution time\", effectively eliminating the impact of Host-side overhead on the measurement."

msgid "前提条件"
msgstr "Prerequisites"

msgid "1. 理解 Host 侧和 Device 侧计时的区别"
msgstr "1\\. Understand the difference between Host-side and Device-side timing"

msgid "社区 `triton.testing.do_bench` 使用`Event`来测量时间，记录的开始和结束时间会包含 Host 侧启动开销。"
msgstr "The community `triton.testing.do_bench` uses `Event` to measure time, and the recorded start and end times include the host-side launch overhead."

msgid "`do_bench_npu` 利用 NPU 性能分析工具（`MSPTI` 或 `torch_npu.profiler`）,保证返回的时间严格是 Device 侧执行时间。"
msgstr "`do_bench_npu` uses NPU performance profiling tools (`MSPTI` or `torch_npu.profiler`) to ensure that the returned time is strictly the Device-side execution time."

msgid "2. 快速路径（`mspti`）的环境要求"
msgstr "2\\. Environment requirements for the fast path (`mspti`)"

msgid "为了实现与社区 `do_bench` 相当的运行速度，`do_bench_npu` 默认尝试使用轻量级的 `mspti` 库。要启用此功能："
msgstr "To achieve a running speed comparable to the community `do_bench`, `do_bench_npu` attempts to use the lightweight `mspti` library by default. To enable this feature:"

msgid "必须可以导入 `mspti` 包。"
msgstr "You must be able to import the `mspti` package."

msgid "如果 CANN 版本低于 9.1.0，需要在 LD_PRELOAD 环境变量中设置 `libmspti.so`。否则，系统将打印警告提示您进行设置。"
msgstr "If the CANN version is earlier than 9.1.0, set `libmspti.so` in the LD_PRELOAD environment variable. Otherwise, the system prints a warning prompting you to set it."

msgid "`libmspti.so`设置方式："
msgstr "How to set up `libmspti.so`:"

msgid "source ${install_path}/set_env.sh\\n"
msgstr "source ${install_path}/set_env.sh"

msgid "其中 `${install_path}` 为 CANN 安装路径，例如 `/usr/local/Ascend/cann`。"
msgstr "Here, ${install_path} is the CANN installation path, for example, /usr/local/Ascend/cann."

msgid "如果 `mspti` 不可用，`do_bench_npu` 将打印警告并自动回退到 `torch_npu.profiler` 路径，该路径较慢但功能完整。"
msgstr "If `mspti` is unavailable, `do_bench_npu` prints a warning and automatically falls back to the `torch_npu.profiler` path, which is slower but fully functional."

msgid "使用说明"
msgstr "Usage Instructions"

msgid "1. 传入单个函数与多个函数的区别"
msgstr "1\\. Difference between passing a single function and multiple functions"

msgid "您可以传入单个可调用对象，也可以传入可调用对象的列表："
msgstr "You can pass a single callable object, or a list of callable objects:"

msgid "# Single function: returns a float\\n"
msgstr "# Single function: returns a float\\n"

msgid "约束："
msgstr "Constraints:"

msgid "当传入单个函数时，`do_bench_npu`会测量`fn`中所有指令的总时间，包括非kernel的指令。因此不要在传入的`fn`中包含无需测量的指令，或者使用`target_kernel_name` 参数。"
msgstr "When you pass in a single function, `do_bench_npu` measures the total time of all instructions in `fn`, including non-kernel instructions. Therefore, do not include instructions that do not need to be measured in the passed `fn`, or use the `target_kernel_name` parameter."

msgid "当传入多个函数时，`do_bench_npu` 只有在每个函数只包含一个 kernel 时，才能准确返回每个函数的 Device 侧时间。如果函数包含多个 kernel（包括非kernel的其他指令），`do_bench_npu` 无法正确区分哪个 kernel 属于哪个函数。请避免测试复杂函数的列表。"
msgstr "When you pass in multiple functions, `do_bench_npu` accurately returns the device-side time of each function only when each function contains a single kernel. If a function contains multiple kernels (including other non-kernel instructions), `do_bench_npu` cannot correctly distinguish which kernel belongs to which function. Avoid testing a list of complex functions."

msgid "2. 清除 L2 Cache"
msgstr "2\\. Clear the L2 cache"

msgid "要测量最坏情况下的性能或模拟冷启动内存场景，可以在每次迭代前清除 L2 缓存："
msgstr "To measure worst-case performance or simulate a cold-start memory scenario, you can clear the L2 cache before each iteration:"

msgid "ms = do_bench_npu(fn, clear_l2_cache=True)\\n"
msgstr "ms = do_bench_npu(fn, clear_l2_cache=True)"

msgid "启用后，`do_bench_npu` 将在每次 fn 调用前执行一个虚拟缓冲区读取操作。 `do_bench_npu` 会自动过滤掉此缓存清除操作消耗的时间。"
msgstr "When enabled, `do_bench_npu` performs a dummy buffer read operation before each fn call. `do_bench_npu` automatically filters out the time consumed by this cache clearing operation."

msgid "3. 按名称对特定 kernel 进行基准测试"
msgstr "3\\. Benchmark a specific kernel by name"

msgid "如果您的 `fn` 包含多个 kernel，但您只想测量其中一个的执行时间，请使用 `target_kernel_name` 参数："
msgstr "If your `fn` contains multiple kernels but you want to measure the execution time of only one, use the `target_kernel_name` parameter:"

msgid "ms = do_bench_npu(fn, target_kernel_name=\"triton_matmul_kernel\")\\n"
msgstr "ms = do_bench_npu(fn, target_kernel_name=\"triton_matmul_kernel\")"

msgid "指定 `target_kernel_name` 后，`do_bench_npu` 将强制回退到 `torch_npu.profiler` 路径。profiler 将解析详细的 CSV 并严格过滤确切的 kernel 名称。 如果捕获到的 kernel 数量与预期的 `(warmup + active)` 迭代次数不匹配，它将抛出 `ProfilerResultMismatchError` 以确保数据完整性。"
msgstr "After you specify `target_kernel_name`, `do_bench_npu` forces a fallback to the `torch_npu.profiler` path. The profiler parses the detailed CSV and strictly filters the exact kernel name. If the number of captured kernels does not match the expected `(warmup + active)` iterations, it throws `ProfilerResultMismatchError` to ensure data integrity."

msgid "4. 保留原始 profiler 结果"
msgstr "4\\. Retain the original profiler results"

msgid "如果您正在调试性能异常，需要检查原始 profiler 输出文件（如 `task_time*.csv` 或 `kernel_details.csv`），请使用："
msgstr "If you are debugging a performance anomaly and need to check the raw profiler output files (such as `task_time*.csv` or `kernel_details.csv`), use:"

msgid "ms = do_bench_npu(fn, prof_dir=\"./my_prof_results\", keep_res=True)\\n"
msgstr "ms = do_bench_npu(fn, prof_dir=\"./my_prof_results\", keep_res=True)"

msgid "设置 `prof_dir` 或 `keep_res=True` 中的任意一个都将强制使用 `torch_npu.profiler` 路径，因为 `mspti` 不会写入这些 CSV 文件。"
msgstr "Setting either `prof_dir` or `keep_res=True` forces the use of the `torch_npu.profiler` path, because `mspti` does not write these CSV files."

msgid "5. 设置预热和运行次数"
msgstr "5\\. Set the warm-up and run counts"

msgid "可以自主传入预热和实际运行次数："
msgstr "You can manually pass in the number of warmup and actual runs:"

msgid "ms = do_bench_npu(fn, warmup=1, active=1)\\n"
msgstr "ms = do_bench_npu(fn, warmup=1, active=1)"

msgid "`warmup`代表在实际计时前运行fn的次数，用于预热。`active`代表fn实际的运行次数，最终结果是这active次迭代的平均值。"
msgstr "`warmup` indicates the number of times fn runs before actual timing for warmup. `active` indicates the actual number of times fn runs, and the final result is the average of these active iterations."

msgid "计时收集的范围与行为"
msgstr "Scope and Behavior of Timing Collection"

msgid "`do_bench_npu` 相对于社区 `do_bench` 的核心扩展集中在准确性和硬件亲和性上。"
msgstr "The core extensions of `do_bench_npu` over the community `do_bench` focus on accuracy and hardware affinity."

msgid "1. 纯 Device 侧时间收集"
msgstr "1\\. Pure device-side time collection"

msgid "收集机制聚焦于片上执行时间。此功能不记录 Host 侧开销或启动延迟。它保证返回的时间严格是 Device 侧 kernel 执行时间的总和。"
msgstr "The collection mechanism focuses on on-chip execution time. This feature does not record Host-side overhead or launch latency. It guarantees that the returned time is strictly the sum of Device-side kernel execution time."

msgid "2. 自动过滤缓存清除操作"
msgstr "2\\. Automatically filter cache clearing operations"

msgid "当使用 `clear_l2_cache=True` 时，profiler 会自动识别并过滤掉用于清除缓存的虚拟 kernel（例如包含 “ReduceSum” 或 “zero” 的操作），确保它们不会污染最终的计时计算。"
msgstr "When using `clear_l2_cache=True`, the profiler automatically identifies and filters out the dummy kernels used for clearing the cache (for example, operations containing \"ReduceSum\" or \"zero\"), ensuring that they do not pollute the final timing calculation."

msgid "3. 单function中含有多kernel的时间收集"
msgstr "3\\. Time collection for a single function containing multiple kernels"

msgid "在实际 NPU 执行中，单次 Triton kernel 启动可能会被底层调度程序拆分为多个硬件任务。`do_bench_npu` 会自动检测捕获到的实际行数（任务数）是否为预期迭代次数的倍数。如果是，它会计算倍数并正确平均时间，从而返回逻辑函数的准确总时间。"
msgstr "In actual NPU execution, the underlying scheduler may split a single Triton kernel launch into multiple hardware tasks. `do_bench_npu` automatically detects whether the actual number of captured rows (task count) is a multiple of the expected iteration count. If so, it calculates the multiplier and correctly averages the time to return the accurate total time of the logical function."

msgid "高级用法：与 Triton Autotune 集成"
msgstr "Advanced usage: integrating with Triton Autotune"

msgid "Triton-Ascend 的 Autotune 扩展支持切换 autotune 基准测试期间使用的性能收集方法。通过设置环境变量 `TRITON_BENCH_METHOD=\"npu\"`，Autotune 机制将在内部调用 `do_bench_npu` 来评估候选配置。"
msgstr "The Triton-Ascend Autotune extension supports switching the performance collection method used during autotune benchmarking. By setting the environment variable `TRITON_BENCH_METHOD=\"npu\"`, the Autotune mechanism internally calls `do_bench_npu` to evaluate candidate configurations."

msgid "export TRITON_BENCH_METHOD=\"npu\"\\n"
msgstr "export TRITON_BENCH_METHOD=\"npu\""

msgid "对于执行时间短的 kernel，建议使用此方法，否则 Host 侧启动延迟将主导社区 `do_bench` 的测量结果，从而导致选择配置非device侧最优。"
msgstr "For kernels with short execution times, it is recommended to use this method. Otherwise, host-side launch latency will dominate the community `do_bench` measurement results, causing the selected configuration to be non-optimal on the device side."

msgid "总结"
msgstr "Summary"

msgid "`do_bench_npu` 相对于社区 `do_bench` 的关键扩展在于从基于事件的计时过渡到基于 profiler 的计时。对于大多数用户，推荐用法是："
msgstr "The key extension of `do_bench_npu` over the community `do_bench` is the transition from event-based timing to profiler-based timing. For most users, the recommended usage is:"

msgid "调用  `do_bench_npu(fn)` 获取纯 Device 侧执行时间；"
msgstr "Call  `do_bench_npu(fn)` to obtain the pure Device-side execution time;"

msgid "如果需要在复杂函数中隔离特定 kernel，请使用 `target_kernel_name`；"
msgstr "If you need to isolate a specific kernel in a complex function, use `target_kernel_name`;"

msgid "如果需要稳定的最坏情况性能基线，请启用 `clear_l2_cache=True`；"
msgstr "If you need a stable worst-case performance baseline, enable `clear_l2_cache=True`;"

msgid "确保安装了 `mspti` ，以保持与社区 `do_bench` 的运行时性能持平。"
msgstr "Ensure that `mspti` is installed to maintain runtime performance on par with the community `do_bench`."
